sequenceDiagram
    participant C as ConsumerContext
    participant D as DLX API
    participant W as DICOMweb<br/>(WADO-RS)

    C->>D: GET /token/{value}<br/>X-DICOM-LINK-EXCHANGE header
    D-->>C: TFA Questions

    C->>D: POST /tokentfa/{value}<br/>TFA Answers
    D-->>C: JWT

    C->>D: GET /api_info<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    D-->>C: Capabilities + WADO-RS URL

    C->>W: GET /studies/{studyUID}<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    W-->>C: DICOM Objects<br/>(limited to studyInstanceUids)
